 "script": "GTA 6 could cost America one billion dollars in a single day. One economist estimates one and a half million American workers will skip work on launch day. That's one percent of the workforce. In the UK, a survey says more than two and a half million will. BambooHR says time off requests for November 19th are nearly 13 percent higher than the same day in past years. Logitech is giving all seven thousand of its staff the day off. Remember, these are estimates, not facts. Are you calling in sick on Thursday? Comment yes or no.",
